    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playground Rumble</strong> is an action-packed roguelike where every toy you find transforms your gameplay in unique ways. Join Miguel and Manuela on an exciting journey to recover their stolen toys, battling hordes of out-of-control playthings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Familiar Worlds:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The House</strong>: Defend Miguel and Manuela\u2019s home, taking on rebellious toys in an environment full of surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Adventures</strong>: Get ready to explore new maps, such as a neighborhood playground, a school, and even a circus filled with mysteries and challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Maps</strong>: Each playthrough is unique, with layouts changing every time you replay, ensuring no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Action</strong>: Face escalating challenges in stages packed with dangers and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons and Strategies</strong>: Choose from 3 distinct weapons, each with unique abilities and playstyles to customize your approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Items</strong>: Discover over 10 items that unlock special abilities and let you create unique strategic combinations.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playground Rumble</strong> is an action-packed roguelike where every toy you find transforms your gameplay in unique ways. Join Miguel and Manuela on an exciting journey to recover their stolen toys, battling hordes of out-of-control playthings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Familiar Worlds:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The House</strong>: Defend Miguel and Manuela\u2019s home, taking on rebellious toys in an environment full of surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Adventures</strong>: Get ready to explore new maps, such as a neighborhood playground, a school, and even a circus filled with mysteries and challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Maps</strong>: Each playthrough is unique, with layouts changing every time you replay, ensuring no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Action</strong>: Face escalating challenges in stages packed with dangers and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons and Strategies</strong>: Choose from 3 distinct weapons, each with unique abilities and playstyles to customize your approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Items</strong>: Discover over 10 items that unlock special abilities and let you create unique strategic combinations.</p></li></ul>",
